{"id":1031101,"name":"赛托·审查Ⅰ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"赛托·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1031101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":31101,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2025-12-12 14:00:00","diary1":"回到狄斯后，你来不及休息，就一头扎进资料的漩涡。你需要证明戾刃力量脱离管束时的可控制性，因为这是未来战局必须使用的力量，也因为赛托和守塔人向你呈现的一切。\n　　但还不等你的报告成型，管理局就接到了一份最高等级的紧急出动要请：对戾刃特别警戒机制被触发，入境处有狂级戾刃，强闯狄斯！","diary2":"劫持女孩、硬闯城门、潜入辛迪加拒捕的戾刃嫌犯居然是赛托！她为什么会在这里，为什么要做这些事？但你所熟悉的她并不是一个会出于恶意挑起争端的人。\n　　你越是想证明守塔人赛托对邪恶武器的驾驭能力、越是要借此获得和戾刃合作的可能性，就越不能出于信任放走赛托，给其他势力可乘之机。你必须借审查搞清她所行的目的与源头。","evidence":[{"ID":260819,"Num":1},{"ID":260821,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260820,"Num":1},{"ID":260822,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131101021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":